VPN Traffic Orchestrator for OPNsense.

Automates NAT, DNS ACL, and policy routing for WireGuard VPN server clients.
Lets remote devices access internal networks or inherit LAN-equivalent routing
rules (including alias-based gateway routing) with zero manual configuration.
Optional per-link egress gateway and kill switch route VPN clients through
another VPN (e.g. an OpenVPN client) without leaking via WAN.
